  "worked_solution": "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a\u2225b.$\n\nSince the angle between $a$ and $b$ is ${0}^{\u2218},$ our vectors must be parallel. \n\nTherefore, $a\\times b=0.$",
